  "engine": "PostgreSQL Docker integration fixture",
  "contract": [
    "The timetz[] fixture contains fractional wall times at the maximum positive and negative offsets, ordinary half-hour offsets, and SQL NULL; native type, array_to_json and array_send provide independent oracles.",
    "BookiE array text rebinds through a typed cast and preserves array_to_json and array_send bytes.",
    "The XLSX cell is a shared string and preserves the complete 107-character array text, including offset seconds, without a formula.",
    "LibreOffice Calc opens XLSX and saves ODS, then reopens ODS and saves XLSX; exact cell text and string cell kinds remain unchanged."
